  "basis": [
    "Builder fixtures require real materialized Steel/Wood tool stats, a real server survival/creative game mode, and the actual held wand. Original block-copy, blocked-cell, stock and wear checks remain.",
    "Every-tool acquisition includes seven pocket modes obtained by native switching from the craftable multitool. A full eight-mode cycle verifies identity, Steel head and wear=7 are retained. No seven invented manual crafting recipes are required.",
    "Head/handle assembly chooses a source-compatible material pair and rejects an incompatible stick. Early rock/flint/obsidian fixtures use an allowed Wood handle rather than the first arbitrary registry stick.",
    "Scanner dispatch uses ServerPlayer as required by its native entrypoint; free plain-block scan and other dispatch families remain. Foam hardening checks the fixed output identity for the original color.",
    "Generic Drill placement uses the source 200-EU action cost; charge count, metadata, reverse inventory priority and remote binding remain.",
    "All 24 attachment variants use the four source roles: tap drains liquid, funnel fills liquid, nozzle drains gas, cap nozzle fills gas. Simulation is read-only, executed gas transfers conserve exact quantity, other directions/phases are rejected.",
    "Named LARGE_COPPER_COIL is the same object as original part 18040. Wrong dense wall still invalidates; restoring the real coil reforms every tested dynamo grade/direction. All electrical boundary checks remain.",
    "Crusher and boiler fixtures wait for tracked structure validation before working or filling. Crusher retains original 50-percent cost and interrupted-work checks. Boiler world NBT retains water while ordinary harvest excludes runtime fluid NBT; source boiler has world writeToNBT2 but no item override for tanks.",
    "PumpWorkRules already adopts original final whole-packet ceiling. Bronze 8191+32=8223 is permitted; 17-RU packets accept482 and reach8194, then refuse more. Simulations, wrong energy and wrong face checks remain. Other pump source differences remain outside scope.",
    "Mini portal actor has an actual survival game mode: toggling abilities on a creative mock does not change isCreative. End-eye activation consumes exactly one; source ignition hooks and saved activity/key checks remain."
  ],
